#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Compact"
msgstr "Компакт."

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Show / hide the VR keyboard. Full = every key; Compact = only the main keys (narrower)."
msgstr ""
"Покажи / скрий VR клавиатурата. Пълна = всички клавиши; Компакт = само основните (по-тясна)."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Bring the menu and the keyboard in front of me"
msgstr "Донеси менюто и клавиатурата пред мен"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Moves the menu and the keyboard to where you look now."
msgstr "Премества менюто и клавиатурата там, където гледаш сега."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Menu open / close: hold %s for %.1f s"
msgstr "Отвори / затвори менюто: задръж %s %.1f с"

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Move: point at a panel, hold the grip, move. Its stick: farther / closer."
msgstr "Преместване: насочи към панел, задръж грипа, движи. Стикът: по-далеч / по-близо."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "The keyboard stays when the menu closes (its x hides it)."
msgstr "Клавиатурата остава, когато менюто се затвори (нейният «x» я скрива)."

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Тъмна"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Синя"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Grey"
msgstr "Сива"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Светла"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Black"
msgstr "Черна"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Green"
msgstr "Зелена"

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Colours"
msgstr "Цветове"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "The colours of the menu and the keyboard."
msgstr "Цветовете на менюто и клавиатурата."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Menu see-through"
msgstr "Прозрачност на менюто"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%d %% solid"
msgstr "%d %% плътно"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "How solid this menu is. - = more see-through, + = more solid."
msgstr "Колко плътно е това меню. - = по-прозрачно, + = по-плътно."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Keyboard see-through"
msgstr "Прозрачност на клавиатурата"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "How solid the VR keyboard is. - = more see-through, + = more solid."
msgstr "Колко плътна е VR клавиатурата. - = по-прозрачна, + = по-плътна."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Pointer smoothing"
msgstr "Изглаждане на показалеца"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Ниско"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "Средно"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "High"
msgstr "Високо"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"Calms a shaky hand: the menu pointer and the air mouse. Higher = steadier, but it follows a bit "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Успокоява треперене на ръката: показалеца и въздушната мишка. Повече = по-плавно, с лек закъснял "
"отклик."

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%s (no font)"
msgstr "%s (няма шрифт)"

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Език"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Auto: %s"
msgstr "Авто: %s"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "The menu's language. Auto = the language the game is set to."
msgstr "Езикът на менюто. Авто = езикът, зададен в играта."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Keyboard letters"
msgstr "Букви на клавиатурата"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"The letters on the VR keyboard, as printed in that country. Auto = as the menu. A key always "
"presses the same key in the game."
msgstr ""
"Буквите на VR клавиатурата, както са в страната. Авто = като менюто. Клавишът винаги натиска "
"същия клавиш в играта."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "- = more see-through, + = more solid."
msgstr "- = по-прозрачно, + = по-плътно."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Steer with"
msgstr "Управление с"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Stick"
msgstr "Стик"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Wheel"
msgstr "Волан"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Point"
msgstr "Насочване"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"Stick: the stick steers. Wheel: hold the grip(s) and turn your hands like a steering wheel. "
"Point: point a controller left / right (on a panel the wheel holds). Off: no driving."
msgstr ""
"Стик: управлява стикът. Волан: задръж грипа(овете) и върти ръце като волан. Насочване: сочи с "
"контролера наляво / надясно (на панел-волан). Изкл: без шофиране."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Hands turn for full lock"
msgstr "Завъртане на ръцете докрай"

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Point for full lock"
msgstr "Насочване докрай"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%.0f deg"
msgstr "%.0f°"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "How far you turn your hands (like a wheel) for full lock. Less = quicker, more = calmer."
msgstr "Колко да завъртиш ръцете (като волан) докрай. По-малко = по-бързо, повече = по-спокойно."

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "How far you point left / right for full lock. Less = quicker, more = calmer."
msgstr "Колко да сочиш наляво / надясно докрай. По-малко = по-бързо, повече = по-спокойно."

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Stick on"
msgstr "Стик вкл"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Stick off"
msgstr "Стик изкл"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"Stick on: the stick steers too (it wins while you push it). Stick off: only your hands steer, and "
"the stick's left / right are normal buttons again."
msgstr ""
"Стик вкл: стикът също управлява (докато го буташ, води той). Стик изкл: управляват само ръцете, а "
"ляво / дясно на стика пак са обикновени бутони."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Hold the wheel with"
msgstr "Дръж волана с"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Either"
msgstr "Който и да е"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"Both: both grips together (one grip alone keeps its own job). Left / Right / Either: one grip is "
"enough -- that grip is then only the wheel (no modifier, no air mouse, no key on it)."
msgstr ""
"Двата: двата грипа заедно (единият грип пази ролята си). Ляв / Десен / Който и да е: стига един — "
"тогава той е само волан (без модификатор, въздушна мишка, клавиш)."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Hand that points"
msgstr "Ръка за насочване"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "The controller you point with. The other hand stays free for the keyboard and the menu."
msgstr "Контролерът, с който сочиш. Другата ръка е свободна за клавиатурата и менюто."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Stick that steers"
msgstr "Стик за управление"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Which stick steers the truck (left / right). Its up / down stay free for other buttons."
msgstr "Кой стик управлява камиона (ляво / дясно). Нагоре / надолу остават за други бутони."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Steering dead zone"
msgstr "Мъртва зона на волана"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"How far you must push the stick before the wheel turns. More = a calm middle, less = it reacts "
"sooner."
msgstr ""
"Колко да избуташ стика, преди воланът да завие. Повече = спокойна среда, по-малко = реагира "
"по-рано."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Small turns (most of the stick)"
msgstr "Малки завои (повечето от стика)"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "even (off)"
msgstr "равно (изкл)"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "up to %d %%"
msgstr "до %d %%"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Most of the stick (the first %d %% of a push) makes small, careful turns, up to this much of the "
"wheel. Only the last bit, at the edge, turns hard."
msgstr ""
"По-голямата част от стика (първите %d %% ход) прави малки, внимателни завои, до тази част от "
"волана. Само краят завива рязко."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Full stick turns the wheel"
msgstr "Пълен стик върти волана"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "How far the wheel turns with the stick pushed all the way. 100 % = full lock."
msgstr "Колко завива воланът при напълно избутан стик. 100 % = докрай."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Wheel follows the stick"
msgstr "Воланът следва стика"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "at once"
msgstr "веднага"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%.3g s"
msgstr "%.3g с"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"Smoothing while you hold the stick: how quickly the wheel goes where the stick points. More = "
"smoother, calmer."
msgstr ""
"Изглаждане, докато държиш стика: колко бързо воланът отива натам, накъдето сочи. Повече = "
"по-плавно, по-спокойно."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Let go: back to the middle"
msgstr "Пускаш — към центъра"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"Let go of the stick: how the wheel comes back to straight. At once = at the wheel speed below. "
"More = a slow glide."
msgstr ""
"Пускаш стика: как воланът се връща към право. Веднага = със скоростта на волана долу. Повече = "
"плавно плъзгане."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Wheel speed at most"
msgstr "Макс. скорост на волана"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "no limit"
msgstr "без лимит"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%.2g s to full"
msgstr "%.2g с докрай"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid ""
"The fastest the wheel turns (full push; a small push turns it slower): seconds from straight to "
"full lock."
msgstr "Най-бързото завъртане на волана (пълен ход; малък — по-бавно): секунди от право до докрай."

#. Name of a setting row (about 30 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "At 90 km/h: steering"
msgstr "При 90 km/h: волан"

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "On"
msgstr "Вкл."

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "(off)"
msgstr "(изкл)"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "On: at speed the wheel turns less, for calm highway driving. The % = how much at 90 km/h."
msgstr "Вкл: при скорост воланът завива по-малко, за спокойно шосе. % = колко при 90 km/h."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Driving off: no steering, gas or brake."
msgstr "Шофиране изкл: без волан, газ и спирачка."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Wheel: hold the grip(s) and turn your hands. Let go = straight."
msgstr "Волан: задръж грипа(овете) и върти ръце. Пускаш = право."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Point: point left / right. On a panel the wheel holds."
msgstr "Насочване: сочи наляво / надясно. На панел-волан."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Most of the stick = small turns. All the way = hard turns."
msgstr "Повечето от стика = малки завои. Докрай = резки."

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Sure? Reset"
msgstr "Сигурно? Нулир."

#. Button (short: about 10 Latin characters; the font shrinks a little when needed)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Reset tab"
msgstr "Нулирай"

#. Help shown at the bottom while the pointer is on something (up to 2 lines, about 110 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Puts this tab back to the default settings. Press twice to be sure."
msgstr "Връща този раздел към стандартните настройки. Натисни два пъти за потвърждение."

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Set: %s + %s = %s"
msgstr "Зададено: %s + %s = %s"

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Set: %s = %s"
msgstr "Зададено: %s = %s"

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Press again: this tab goes back to the defaults."
msgstr "Натисни пак: този раздел ще се върне към стандартните."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Back to the defaults. Saved."
msgstr "Върнато към стандартните. Запазено."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Запазено."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Choose that modifier button first (the buttons above)."
msgstr "Първо избери този бутон-модификатор (бутоните горе)."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Steering with the wheel: those grips hold it (Driving tab)."
msgstr "Волан: тези грипове го държат (раздел «Шофиране»)."

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%s holds the wheel (Driving tab)."
msgstr "%s държи волана (раздел «Шофиране»)."

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%s is modifier 1."
msgstr "%s е модификатор 1."

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%s is modifier 2."
msgstr "%s е модификатор 2."

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%s is the air mouse button (Mouse tab)."
msgstr "%s е бутонът за въздушна мишка (раздел «Мишка»)."

#. Value or choice (about 18 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "With these modifiers, %s opens the menu."
msgstr "С тези модификатори %s отваря менюто."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "That stick moves the mouse (Mouse tab)."
msgstr "Този стик движи мишката (раздел «Мишка»)."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "That stick steers (Driving tab)."
msgstr "Този стик управлява (раздел «Шофиране»)."

#. Status / hint line at the bottom (one line, about 55 Latin characters)
#: src/vr_menu.cpp
msgid "Could not save config.ini (the change works until the game ends)."
msgstr "config.ini не можа да се запази (промяната важи до края на играта)."

